{"info": {"address1": "C-113, Naraina Industrial Area", "address2": "Phase-1", "city": "New Delhi", "zip": "110028", "country": "India", "phone": "91 11 4141 0000", "fax": "91 11 4141 0060", "website": "https://archiesonline.com", "industry": "Specialty Retail", "industryKey": "specialty-retail", "industryDisp": "Specialty Retail", "sector": "Consumer Cyclical", "sectorKey": "consumer-cyclical", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Cyclical", "longBusinessSummary": "Archies Limited engages in the retail sale of cultural, recreation, and other goods in India and internationally. It operates through Greeting Cards; Stationery and Paper Bag Items; Gifts; and Others segments. The company offers birthday products; jewellery and accessories comprising necklaces, earrings, tote bags, bracelets, keychains, watches, wallets, and bags; greeting cards; gift products consisting of mugs, showpieces, soft toys, divine idols and gifts, photo albums and frames, handing, clocks, candles, water bottles and flasks, trophies, pen stands, wind chimes, quotations, glassware and bar accessories, artificial flowers, and card cases, as well as chocolates; and same day delivery and personalized gift products. It also provides stationery products comprising notebooks, diaries, quotation books, collectibles, scrap books, shagun envelopes, calendars, paper bags, and scrolls; beauty and personal care products, such as deodorant, perfume, fragrance gift set, and skincare products under the Archies Perfume, Bel Avenir, Elitty Beauty, Nacharel, Ajmal, and IKYK Perfumes; and occasions and sale products. In addition, the company offers printing services. It sells its products under the Archies brand through a distribution network comprising company owned stores, franchisees, distributors, and retailers, as well as through online websites, marketplaces, and quick commerce platforms. The company exports its products to the United States, the United Kingdom, Canada, the Netherlands, Oman, and Nepal. Archies Limited 